{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLASH AND DIE</strong> is a first-person horror game where you take photos of houses for a real estate agency. They\u2019ve decided to try something new and unusual \u2013 night shots of their listings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/d3a7ea65c37354bc93e7f6578694f65a.poster.avif?t=1774033175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/d3a7ea65c37354bc93e7f6578694f65a.webm?t=1774033175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/d3a7ea65c37354bc93e7f6578694f65a.mp4?t=1774033175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to capture every room on your checklist as you explore dark hallways and hidden corners in search of the best angles for your photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/605ee9b1dbe7b311177920445ecf2129.poster.avif?t=1774033175\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/605ee9b1dbe7b311177920445ecf2129.webm?t=1774033175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985060/extras/605ee9b1dbe7b311177920445ecf2129.mp4?t=1774033175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is still inside. Finish your job or <strong>never leave.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"